{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120039","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120039/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120039/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120039/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120039","id":4600383310,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7jRyhF","number":120039,"title":"Remove unnessecary `get_singleton()` calls to improve code readiblity and performance (for `/editor/*`)","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-06-05T21:52:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T14:34:05Z","closed_at":"2026-06-10T14:32:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120039","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120039","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120039.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120039.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Implements section \"_Use of RD::get_singleton()_\" of https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7366 for the folder `editor/` (if I did everything, the review process of this would be chaotic and probably never finish)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"871\" height=\"882\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4faaba0b-6246-4238-a823-71321ed31058\" />\r\n\r\nTake a look aswell at the comments under that proposal:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7366#issuecomment-1648788495\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7366#issuecomment-1649017617\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7366#issuecomment-1649157413\r\n\r\n## Summary of changes\r\n\r\nWhen there are a lot of `get_singleton()` calls next to each other, store the result of that call once and use it instead.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1172\" height=\"480\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e74d257-bffc-4ad0-a60a-a6460000d659\" />\r\n\r\nThis is already implemented in some places, so this makes it consistent.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nWhile the main goal of these changes is to make the code more readable, the performance gain may also exist:\r\n\r\nWhen compiling, I noticed a 11 KB file size reduce, showing that the compiler doesn't optimize this:\r\n\r\n`scons platform=windows target=editor optimize=speed`\r\nbase = 166123008\r\npr = 166111744\r\ndiff = -11264\r\n\r\n`scons platform=windows target=editor optimize=speed lto=full`\r\nbase = 202290688\r\npr = 202279424\r\ndiff = -11264\r\n\r\nThe actual runtime impact is close to none (only a few instructions/clock cycles per function), but eliminating unnecessary work is good.\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\n\r\nIs it worth it to do the change for only two calls?\r\n\r\nHow should the variable storing the pointer (result of the get_singleton) be named? Currently I did it by the feel of the function (sometimes `audio_server`, in other scenarios `as`), but I feel like we should establish some rules.\r\n\r\n## AI Disclosure\r\n\r\nA python program to detect excessive use of `::get_singleton()` was written by Claude.\r\nAll code was written by me.","closed_by":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120039/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":2,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120039/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}